---
title: Vegan Pizza
description: The BEST vegan pizza made with a garlic-herb crust, simple tomato sauce, TONS of sautéed veggies, and vegan parmesan cheese. Thin crust, tons of flavor, and ridiculously satisfying.
image: https://minimalistbaker.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/The-Best-Vegan-Pizza-SQUARE.jpg
servings: '2'
time required: 40 minutes
prep time: 20 minutes
